   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48E7

   1 a 0000 E48E7:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2e] a literal-left TEST compare whose right operand
   4 a 0006      is a level-numbered FIXED CHARACTER member.  [C297] shows DR
   5 a 0006      accepting that member class on the PUT file route with MVI
   6 a 0006      A,declared-length / ?SLCTS, and [C326] measures the same
   7 a 0006      orientation on a VARYING member with ?SCCVM; no object names a
   8 a 0006      helper for a FIXED character compare. */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 name char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if 'AB' = rec.name then k = 1;
  15 c 001C   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003E   stop;
  17 a 0041 end E48E7;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3879
END  COMPILATION
